    {
      "id": "03-fats",
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "fats",
      "text": "21.5 grams of fat. Omega 3 is 265 milligrams, supporting cell and heart function, but modest beside oily fish. Saturated fat is 13.3 grams, seriously heavy even for cheese. Polyunsaturated fat is only 0.59 grams, with little unsaturated fat to soften the blow. Cholesterol is 89 milligrams, adding more baggage. For dairy, fat quality matters, and feta's is rough.",
      "textSha256": "309e33eb1d2b626a0b933f8d5d25827fc15b508fce86b5ba68debcf6834fdf48",
      "characterCount": 364,
      "byteLength": 377043,
