    {
      "id": "04-carbs",
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "carbs",
      "text": "3.9 grams of carbs. Sugar and starch are both 0 grams, and the glycemic index around 27 sits low. Fibre is also 0 grams, so feta brings no plant-based fullness or digestion support. For dairy, this section is harmless rather than helpful. Let the meal bring the fibre.",
      "textSha256": "ddc988ebefa305398961800095fa4dc1d30ba1c60bb41a311da1feac93cc2d6b",
      "characterCount": 268,
      "byteLength": 242460,
